<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela General de Seguros sold for $9mln.</title>
<headline>Venezuela General de Seguros sold for $9mln.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caracas-based Andino Capital Markets bought a 99 percent stake in Venezuelan insurance company General de Seguros for 4.3 billion bolivars ($9 million), former owner Banco Consolidado said.</p>
<p>The sale price topped the 2.5 billion bolivar base price.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
</text>
